# Fetched corpus content is NEVER committed (MASTER_PLAN §2, §10):
# fetch scripts, not vendored copies. Upstream licences are respected by
# fetching at a pinned SHA and recording the licence, not by redistributing.
#
# Note the `/**` rather than `/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is itself excluded, so excluding the *contents* is what lets the
# `.gitkeep` markers below survive.
/helm-charts/**
/kustomize/**
/terraform/**
/k8s-manifests/**
/lockfiles/**
/pdfs/**
/csv/**

# Keep the destination directories in the tree so the layout matches
# MASTER_PLAN §2 in a fresh clone.
!/*/.gitkeep
